    "name": "My Axion Shop",
    "steam_appid": 3734580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/07ad2a21f8263aa6a77d04f6ba8b9735.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/07ad2a21f8263aa6a77d04f6ba8b9735.webm?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/07ad2a21f8263aa6a77d04f6ba8b9735.mp4?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own Axion shop, collect rare parts, create powerful combinations, and battle your way to becoming a Pro Axioner! My Axion Shop offers a unique gaming experience blending strategy, trading, and collection elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your destiny \u2014 or master both:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rise as a Pro Axioner</strong>: <br>Collect Axion Points, battle your way from amateur to <strong>Legend Rank</strong>, and build your reputation across the streets and tournaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Axion Shop</strong>: <br>Customize your store, attract more customers, unlock new parts, and become the go-to place for elite Axioners.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is yours to shape. <strong>Fight for glory, build for legacy \u2014 or do both.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/f6702898a1eb8802778deaf3e0edbeb4.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/f6702898a1eb8802778deaf3e0edbeb4.webm?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/f6702898a1eb8802778deaf3e0edbeb4.mp4?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR SHOP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish and expand your own Axion shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the market economy by buying and selling parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your customers satisfied and build your shop's reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare pieces and grow your business with strategic decisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/eae3664f6c48b5731620c509d38c7ad1.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/eae3664f6c48b5731620c509d38c7ad1.webm?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/eae3664f6c48b5731620c509d38c7ad1.mp4?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLES &amp; TOURNAMENTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge rivals</strong> with your carefully assembled Axion combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain Axion Points\u00a0</strong>and grow your reputation through dynamic <strong>street battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Participate in tournaments</strong> to win <strong>valuable rewards</strong> and <strong>exclusive parts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop unique battle strategies</strong> based on Axion types, synergy, and timing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Don\u2019t Just Control Your Axion \u2014 You Become One With It</strong> <br>This isn\u2019t just a battle \u2014 it\u2019s a test of instinct, reflex, and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>keyboard or gamepad</strong>, take <strong>full real-time control</strong>: launch, dodge, strike, and dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/3d622591a6c72044b6302cdb5a89d393.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/3d622591a6c72044b6302cdb5a89d393.webm?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/3d622591a6c72044b6302cdb5a89d393.mp4?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBINE AXION PARTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique Axions from various components like Crest, Power Ring, Impact Disk, Core, Stabilizer, and Tip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your perfect strategy by balancing stats such as Attack, Defense, and Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft diverse strategies with different Axion types: Attack, Defense, Balance, and Stamina</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/29986c07a076f8d9be786f0d2b96d858.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/29986c07a076f8d9be786f0d2b96d858.webm?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/29986c07a076f8d9be786f0d2b96d858.mp4?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > EXPAND YOUR COLLECTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect parts in five different rarity levels from Common to Legendary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover special and rare components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others for the most valuable parts</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Shop Management:</strong> Run and develop your own Axion shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battle System:</strong> Defeat rivals using part combinations and stat balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Collection System:</strong> Gather hundreds of parts across different rarity levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Tournaments:</strong> Test your skills in  special tournaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Progression Paths:</strong> Climb the ranks as a Pro Axioner while expanding your custom shop business</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/07ad2a21f8263aa6a77d04f6ba8b9735.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/07ad2a21f8263aa6a77d04f6ba8b9735.webm?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/07ad2a21f8263aa6a77d04f6ba8b9735.mp4?t=1752786801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own Axion shop, collect rare parts, create powerful combinations, and battle your way to becoming a Pro Axioner! My Axion Shop offers a unique gaming experience blending strategy, trading, and collection elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your destiny \u2014 or master both:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rise as a Pro Axioner</strong>: <br>Collect Axion Points, battle your way from amateur to <strong>Legend Rank</strong>, and build your reputation across the streets and tournaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Axion Shop</strong>: <br>Customize your store, attract more customers, unlock new parts, and become the go-to place for elite Axioners.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is yours to shape. <strong>Fight for glory, build for legacy \u2014 or do both.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/f6702898a1eb8802778deaf3e0edbeb4.poster.avif?t=1752786801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734580/extras/f6702898